CHANGES FOR FISCAL YEAR 2015
CHANGES FOR FISCAL YEAR 2015
 Convert from the AS/400 server to a Microsoft Platform (MSP)
server (already funded)
 Implement wireless and paperless field crime reporting for pa-
trol officer (already funded) but delayed from FY 2014 due to
