City’s Innoprise system
 Appropriately fund salary and overtime expenses for all author-
ized staffing,
 Appropriately fund increasing jail expenses
 Appropriately fund computer software maintenance programs
 Fund the Police Department’s share of the automated vehicle
locator project, which is estimated at $20,000
